\title{VAPOR: Vector Autoregressive Precision factOR Models}
\description{
Joint Bayesian estimation of vector autoregression dynamics and a sparse innovation precision matrix. The VAR coefficients receive a Dirichlet-Laplace prior and the innovation precision matrix is modeled as a low-rank plus diagonal factor decomposition with a Dirichlet-Laplace prior on the loadings and a Dirichlet process prior on the idiosyncratic variances. A single Gibbs sampler updates both jointly.
